    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Try our latest game while you wait!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701070/extras/f2efac3d5a76eeed7421debc1ed64e99.avif?t=1754872983\" width=600 height=140 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701070/extras/57c0c84f6b6143e5bf4f7c31999e138a.avif?t=1754872983\" width=616 height=110 /></span><br><br>A mysterious wave of serial murders have begun to hit Tokyo, with crime scenes defying explanation. As one of the &quot;Lucky Two&quot;, you've beaten the odds, and won a contest that grants you a luxurious spot in a pop idol's world tour; promising the adventure of a lifetime. With Tokyo as your first stop, however, events quickly escalate. You'll soon become an important figure in a struggle that spans multiple worlds, and their puzzling connection. You may not only be the key to solving these mysterious murders - but you may hold the fate of all existence in your hands as well. Enjoy your adventure, and choose wisely... [/p]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701070/extras/f2a12fdf584a9cb1c03d8982d3ecbde4.avif?t=1754872983\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>This is a re-imagining of the original visual novel released in 2016, and includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Completely Re-Written Script  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > New Dialogue Choices </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > New User Interface</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701070/extras/f2efac3d5a76eeed7421debc1ed64e99.avif?t=1754872983\" width=600 height=140 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701070/extras/57c0c84f6b6143e5bf4f7c31999e138a.avif?t=1754872983\" width=616 height=110 /></span><br><br>A mysterious wave of serial murders have begun to hit Tokyo, with crime scenes defying explanation. As one of the &quot;Lucky Two&quot;, you've beaten the odds, and won a contest that grants you a luxurious spot in a pop idol's world tour; promising the adventure of a lifetime. With Tokyo as your first stop, however, events quickly escalate. You'll soon become an important figure in a struggle that spans multiple worlds, and their puzzling connection. You may not only be the key to solving these mysterious murders - but you may hold the fate of all existence in your hands as well. Enjoy your adventure, and choose wisely... [/p]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701070/extras/f2a12fdf584a9cb1c03d8982d3ecbde4.avif?t=1754872983\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>This is a re-imagining of the original visual novel released in 2016, and includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Completely Re-Written Script  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > New Dialogue Choices </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > New User Interface</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Become intertwined in the fateful connection plaguing two worlds, bound together by a murder mystery, and a competition for the throne of a god. The award-winning visual novel, completely revamped! New script, new choices! Become The Savior today...",
    "supported_languages": "English",
    "reviews": "\u201cEvery character in Major\\Minor displays some form of moral ambiguity, and their overall complexity is what keeps them and their intertwining stories intriguing. (Review for the original 2016 Major\\Minor)\u201d<br />\r\nRPGFan<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cMajor\\Minor does the major parts right in a lot of clever and beautiful ways. The world is fantastic, the art is wonderful, and the plot is filled with twists and turns. (Review for the original 2016 Major\\Minor)\u201d<br />\r\nCubed3<br />\r\n",
